  <!-- EN: Ratkin Radio -->
  <RKU_Radio.label>地鼠电台</RKU_Radio.label>
  <!-- EN: The Ratkin Underground Radio: Interaction with partisan forces is conducted via this radio. The partisans' attitude, the radio's functions, and the events/quests that will be triggered are all determined by the current favorability level of the partisans. When the favorability level reaches a certain upper limit or lower limit (one tier every 25 points), you need to interact with the partisan leader to expand the range of the favorability level. -->
  <RKU_Radio.description>地鼠电台，通过电台来与游击队势力交互，游击队的态度、电台的功能和会触发的事件/任务由游击队当前的好感度决定，在达到一定上限或下限（25一级）时需要与游击队领导者交互以拓展好感度范围</RKU_Radio.description>
  
  <!-- EN: Trading Post -->
